{
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "ShadRecordList",
      "name": "ShadRecordList",
      "description": "List of records as two-line rows, for a recent-orders, people, tickets or activity panel beside a chart or a table: an avatar (avatarField: an image URL, else the initials of that field's text, else of the title), the title (titleField), a meta line under it (metaFields, a comma list of field specs joined with ' · ': 'city', 'total|currency', 'due|date:Due {}' (value in a label), 'seats:Seats' (label first); formats number, currency, percent, compact, date, datetime), a progress bar under the meta line (progressField: a percentage 0 to 100, as 42 or '42%'; onboarding, a project's completion), a status chip on the right (statusField, toned by its words: Paid green, Pending amber, Overdue red, Open blue) and a trailing value (valueField in valueFormat: currency in currency, date, number, ...). density compact, default or comfortable; showDividers; listStyle 'card' (bordered panel) or 'plain'; avatarShape circle or rounded. A click selects the row (selectedItem, selectedItemId, selectedItemIndex; onItemClicked). Draws 100 rows and a Show more button. Height: grows with its rows (about 60px a row at default density)",
      "defaultSize": {
        "width": 20,
        "height": 340
      },
      "properties": [
        {
          "key": "data",
          "label": "Data",
          "valueType": "array",
          "default": "{{[{ id: 1, customer: 'Harbor Bistro', contact: 'Maya Chen', due: '2026-10-14', status: 'Paid', total: 1240 }, { id: 2, customer: 'Northwind Florists', conta…"
        },
        {
          "key": "titleField",
          "label": "Title field",
          "valueType": "string",
          "default": "customer"
        },
        {
          "key": "avatarField",
          "label": "Avatar field (image URL or a name; empty uses the title)",
          "valueType": "string",
          "default": ""
        },
        {
